<title>NETHERLANDS: SOCCER-DUTCH FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-DUTCH FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-09-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of Dutch first</p>
<p>division soccer played on Sunday:</p>
<p>Vitesse Arnhem 4 (Jochemsen 27th 35th, Mackaay 37th 79th)</p>
<p>Feyenoord Rotterdam 2 (Sanchez 75th, Schuiteman 80th). Halftime</p>
<p>3-0. Attendance 9,915.</p>
<p>Twente Enschede 1 (Bruggink 3rd) Ajax Amsterdam 1 (Bogarde</p>
<p>92nd). Halftime 1-0. Attendance 10,500</p>
<p>Groningen 1 (Kooistra 66th) AZ Alkmaar 0. Halftime 0-0.</p>
<p>Attendance 10,300.</p>
<p>RKC Waalwijk 1 (Van Diemen 61st) NAC Breda 2 (Stewart 42nd,</p>
<p>Abellaoui 43rd). Halftime 0-2. Attendance 4,500.</p>
<p>Sparta Rotterdam 1 (Dennis de Nooyer 5th) NEC Nijmegen 0.</p>
<p>Halftime 1-0. Attendance 3,500</p>
<p>Volendam 2 (Govedarica 18th, Samardzic 33rd penalty) Heerenveen</p>
<p>2 (Dahl Tomasson 11th penalty, El Kattabi 54th). Halftime 2-1.</p>
<p>Attendance 4,000.</p>
<p>Utrecht 2 (Mols 20th, Van Loen 35th) PSV Eindhoven 2 (Stam</p>
<p>19th, Nilis 69th). Halftime 2-1. Attendance 10,000.</p>
<p>Played on Saturday:</p>
<p>Graafschap Doetinchem 2 (Godee 16th, Taiwo 87th) Willem II</p>
<p>Tilburg 2 (Van de Berg 11th, Konterman 20th) Halftime 1-2.</p>
<p>Attendance 8,250.</p>
<p>Roda JC Kerkrade 0 Fortuna Sittard 1 (Roest 79th penalty).</p>
<p>Halftime 0-0. Attendance 7,000.</p>
</text>
